    <selectionEntry id="8b94-efb3-59f4-db29" name="M6 Spartan Laser" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="model">
      <comment>Buy from Weapons, then use the link button to attach to a unit. Restriction: Any model. Max 1 of this weapon per fireteam; per unit max 1 Extra Ranged.</comment>
